    </div>
    <div class="card p-3">
      <h4 class="text-base font-semibold mb-2">2) MCP Server</h4>
      <div class="text-xs">Routes query → tools</div>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-4 text-xs space-y-0.5 mb-0">
        <li>search_components</li>
        <li>validate</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="card p-3">
      <h4 class="text-base font-semibold mb-2">3) Retrieval & Grounding</h4>
      <div class="text-xs">Vector DB + docs</div>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-4 text-xs space-y-0.5 mb-0">
        <li>Pinecone results (k=3)</li>
        <li>Design tokens & a11y</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="card p-3">
      <h4 class="text-base font-semibold mb-2">4) Guidance & Output</h4>
      <div class="text-xs">Assist, validate, generate</div>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-4 text-xs space-y-0.5 mb-0">
        <li>Recommend component, React</li>
        <li>A11y checklist</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</Terminal>

<h3 id="poc-implementation" class="text-xl mt-6 mb-2">POC Implementation</h3>
<p>The initial implementation validated the flow: query → retrieve → answer with code samples grounded in real tokens and components.</p>

